WEBVTT

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:06.848
Recovery companies, welcome to The Motoring Central. This is how it works, and what's in it for you.

00:00:07.648 --> 00:00:19.832
It starts with a driver who's stuck. They tell us where the vehicle is, by postcode, or by dropping a pin on the map. Then they answer a few quick questions. What is it? Does it roll? Is it on the road, or in a ditch?

00:00:20.632 --> 00:00:28.657
Then they see your company, your truck, and your price. A fixed price, worked out from your own rates. They pay online, there and then, and the job is yours.

00:00:29.457 --> 00:00:41.116
And the prices really are yours. Pick the trucks you run from our pictures. For each one, set your call-out, your price per mile, and any miles you include. We always quote your cheapest truck that can actually do the job.

00:00:41.916 --> 00:00:52.267
You set your own price list for extras, too. Dollies, skates, winching, accident damage, waiting time. If the customer's answers make an extra certain, it's in the price from the start.

00:00:53.067 --> 00:01:03.366
And if you only find out on the day? Add it on your phone. The customer signs on your screen, or approves it online, before you carry on. No arguments later, and it's added to your payout.

00:01:04.166 --> 00:01:16.274
You choose when you work. Go available for a few hours with one tap. Or set your opening hours once, even 24/7, and the bookings come in on their own. We never send more jobs at once than you have trucks.

00:01:17.074 --> 00:01:29.435
Every job lands on your dashboard, and in your email. You get the customer's name and number, the registration, and a map showing where the vehicle is, and where it's going. Tap on my way, and the customer is kept up to date.

00:01:30.235 --> 00:01:42.663
So, what does it cost? One flat fee. 10% plus VAT, and only on jobs you complete. No monthly fee, no membership, and no joining fee. On a £150 job, you keep £132.

00:01:43.463 --> 00:01:55.390
You're paid every week, straight to your bank. We raise the invoice for you, so there's no paperwork to chase, and your statement shows every job. And if a customer cancels after you've set off, you still keep your call-out.

00:01:56.190 --> 00:02:04.150
You also get your own profile, with your logo and a link to your website. A vehicle inspection tool, to record any damage before you load.

00:02:04.897 --> 00:02:14.660
Joining takes about five minutes. Tell us about your company, upload your insurance and photo ID, and set up your trucks. We check your documents, and you're ready to go.

00:02:15.460 --> 00:02:21.833
Your trucks, your prices, and paid every week. Join the network today, at motoringcentral.co.uk.
